Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 17:28:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/25] A Monday-morning word from the app

A few lines to destinations flagged for status notices, at 08:00 on Monday
in the configured timezone: listings found and across how many searches,
alerts sent, price drops, how many the agent judged and the best of them,
the busiest searches, refusals so far. The slot that was served is written
to app_state so a restart on Monday does not repeat it. WEEKLY_REPORT=false
turns it off.
